"Clear?" is yes when the whole range lies above zero.

**What is shown, and what is not.**

* *Shown by the data:* the model ranks outlets for display kits and rep visits better than chance (its
  advantage over random targeting is positive, with a range above zero, for both; details in the technical report); the limits cost about {{ pbc.est_difference | r3 | vnd }} VND per outlet-month; and when the
