  {{ n.placebo.n_successful }} shuffled tries, so it is not
  finding patterns in noise.
* *Shown only by the simulation:* the model picks the right action twice as often as BAU (both without limits).
* *Not shown:* that the model beats BAU when both respect the limits. The simulation says it does, but the two
  estimates in the table are {{ (pgl.true_difference - pgl.est_difference) | vnd }} to
